### 1. See the seeded reference data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reference

### 2. Generic drug: pays at MAC price, goes toward the deductible
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{"pharmacyId":"PH-001","rxNumber":"RX1001","fillNumber":0,"memberId":"M1001","ndc":"11111-2222-01",
 "quantity":30,"daysSupply":30,"dateOfService":"2026-12-01","usualAndCustomary":12.00}

### 3. Same claim again (switch retry): returns the original answer, duplicate=true
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{"pharmacyId":"PH-001","rxNumber":"RX1001","fillNumber":0,"memberId":"M1001","ndc":"11111-2222-01",
 "quantity":30,"daysSupply":30,"dateOfService":"2026-12-01","usualAndCustomary":12.00}

### 4. Brand drug: AWP minus 15% + fee, deductible then $40 copay
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{"pharmacyId":"PH-001","rxNumber":"RX1002","fillNumber":0,"memberId":"M1001","ndc":"22222-3333-01",
 "quantity":30,"daysSupply":30,"dateOfService":"2026-12-01","usualAndCustomary":400.00}

### 5. Specialty drug with prior auth on file: $250 specialty copay
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{"pharmacyId":"PH-001","rxNumber":"RX1003","fillNumber":0,"memberId":"M1001","ndc":"33333-4444-01",
 "quantity":2,"daysSupply":28,"dateOfService":"2026-12-01","usualAndCustomary":9000.00}

