### 10. Out-of-network pharmacy: reject 50
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{"pharmacyId":"PH-999","rxNumber":"RX1008","fillNumber":0,"memberId":"M1001","ndc":"11111-2222-01",
 "quantity":30,"daysSupply":30,"dateOfService":"2026-12-01","usualAndCustomary":12.00}

### 11. Check the member's accumulators
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/M1001/accumulators/2026

### 12. Reverse a claim (paste a claimId from a PAID response)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims/PASTE-CLAIM-ID/reversal

### 13. See the outbox events (published by the relay every 2 seconds)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outbox
